Hey, beat it, Junior.

14
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:40,417
Junior, you're talking to the official
commissioner for the Battle City tournament.

15
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,777
I will settle any and
all dueling disputes,

16
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:45,137
