rules, what I say goes.

17
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,780
Do I make myself clear?

18
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:48,337
I'll keep that in mind.

19
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:49,250
Now get lost.

20
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:52,697
If you want to stay in this tournament,
you're going to have to do what I say.

21
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:53,610
Or what?

22
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:55,920
