30
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:20,180
It's time you learned
to show some respect.

31
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:23,720
Whoa, whoa, amazing!

32
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,837
What's up with all these rare cards?

33
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:28,340
I challenge you to a duel here and now.

34
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,960
With one condition,

35
00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:34,867
