the dueling power of your pathetic deck.

36
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,320
You're sure about this?

37
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:47,160
With all these rare cards and my skill,
There's no way I'll lose watch out kaiba.

38
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:49,800
You're setting yourself up for a fall

