Once again, I'll be the number
one duelist in the world.

53
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:06,157
Hmm, so Obelisk the
Tormenter has been played?

54
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:09,160
Yes, moments ago in Battle City, Merrick,

