what is rightfully mine.

64
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,100
Now open the lid, my servant.

65
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:43,610
Excellent

66
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:47,340
Unlock the safe

67
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:53,020
There it is,

68
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:57,237
the winged dragon of Ra That makes two One

69
00:04:57,320 --> 00:05:00,120
more Egyptian god card
and I'll be unstoppable

70
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:02,680
Don't take another step

71
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,510
Ishizu

72
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:10,420
Brother, my millennium necklace warned me
you would betray me And indeed you have

73
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:16,780
5,000 years ago, our family swore to
protect the pharaoh's tomb until his return.

74
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:20,877
Who knew that the greatest threat
