mine from the very beginning, sister.

77
00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:31,797
Soon, instead of guarding the
pharaoh, I'll inherit his strength.

78
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:36,217
My destiny lies in the cards,
the three Egyptian god cards.

79
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:41,980
If you want to carry out this madness,
you're going to have to find the last card.

80
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,900
