83
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:07,120
I know my sister gave the third
Egyptian god card to Seto Kaiba.

84
00:06:07,340 --> 00:06:11,740
She used her Millennium Necklace to
foresee the events of Battle City.

85
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:15,560
Is Shizu new if she gave
Obelisk the Tormenter to Kaiba?

86
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:20,320
He'd throw a tournament out of green
to obtain the other Egyptian god cards.

87
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:23,537
