of their true strength.

88
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:27,385
And once I have them all, the
power of the pharaoh will be mine.

89
00:06:27,660 --> 00:06:30,840
However, first I'll need
to weaken the pharaoh.

90
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:34,720
