task to tend to first.

94
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:51,800
Dispatch Arcana to take down Yugi Moto.

95
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,160
Yes, sir.

96
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:00,040
Okay, Serenity.

97
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:01,418
I'll see you later.

98
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:05,077
I'm going to go down and see
how Yugi and Joey are doing.

99
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,990
Bye!

100
00:07:06,580 --> 00:07:09,500
Um, Tristan, will you
promise me something? Sure.

101
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,717
Will you take me downtown
to the Battle City

102
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:14,577
Tournament on the day that
I get my bandages removed?

103
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:15,542
To Battle City?

104
00:07:16,340 --> 00:07:17,170
Yeah.

105
00:07:17,253 --> 00:07:21,097
It's really important to me that the first
sight I see is my brother Joey dueling.

106
00:07:21,180 --> 00:07:22,480
It would be my honor.

107
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,240
Catch you later

108
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:27,660
That was an awesome duel,

109
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:33,140
Joey Yeah I'm impressed by how much your
dueling skills have improved Thanks a lot,

110
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:36,640
Gramps Well, we're off to find Yugi Okay,

111
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,280
later Good luck

112
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:46,817
I'm glad Joey let us hang
on to his Red-Eyes Black

113
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:50,194
Dragon That's his favorite
card And now that we have it,

114
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:55,140
it's like his heart's in our deck No
matter where we are, Joey will be with us.

115
00:07:55,340 --> 00:07:58,157
And if we have to face Merrick
and his army of rare hunters,

116
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:00,657
we're going to need all
the support we can get.

117
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:04,537
I just hope that Joey can survive
the tournament without his red eyes.

118
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:05,450
He can.

119
00:08:05,533 --> 00:08:09,817
Joey is a great duelist, and he seems
to get better with every duel he fights.

120
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:12,237
He just has to keep believing in himself.

121
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:15,357
Yeah, Joey has come a really
long way since his first duel.

122
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:18,911
And he just defeated Esperobo
without needing his red eyes.

123
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:22,800
Maybe we need Joey's card to
help save the world from evil.

124
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:28,597
Speaking of evil, how will we know
where Merrick will strike next?

125
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,268
