extra downside to losing.

227
00:14:31,860 --> 00:14:32,797
Get ready.

228
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:36,740
The show, I mean duel,
is about to begin! Ah!

229
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:38,490
No!

230
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:41,290
Relax!

231
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:45,080
We're both locked in, which
means neither of us can escape!

232
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:47,960
See, there's an extra twist!

233
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:50,497
We're not just playing for
what's inside your deck,

234
00:14:50,580 --> 00:14:53,051
