235
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:56,140
What's that?

236
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:02,780
It's a dark energy disk, Yu-Gi,

237
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:08,380
and I wouldn't get too close One touch and
your mind's banished to the Shadow Realm

238
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:16,640
Don't worry, Yu-Gi I'll explain
the rules to you before you lose

239
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:21,140
See the numbers written
above the energy disks?

240
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:25,580
Those are life points The
closer the number gets to zero,

241
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:28,240
the closer the disc gets to us. Precisely.

242
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:31,057
And then you can say
hello to the Shadow Realm.

243
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:33,800
All right, now look
down between your feet.

244
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:36,600
You'll see each of us has a key box.

245
00:15:38,340 --> 00:15:39,540
A key box?

246
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:44,200
Yes, and inside is a key to unlock
the shackles around your legs.

247
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:47,717
